sentences.text:
The petitioner is directed to be enlarged on bail in Crime No.116/2023 of Yeshwanthpura Police Station registered for the offences punishable under Sections 506, 341, 34, 504, 420 and 324 of the IPC, subject to the following conditions:
a) Petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- (Rupees One Lakh only) NC: 2023:KHC:29297 with two sureties for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
d) The petitioner shall not leave the jurisdiction of the Trial Court without permission of the said Court until the case registered against him is disposed off.
e) The petitioner shall not involve in similar offences in future.
Sd/-
JUDGE JY CT:PH Sri. Mahesh vs The State Of Karnataka on 18 August, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/85909788/
